    "markdown": "Before\n\n| Name | Notes |\n| --- | --- |\n| **Bold** and _italic_ | ~~old~~ `code` |\n| @Alice Smith | [Spec](https://example.com/spec \"Read me\") |\n| **bold _and italic_** |  |\n\nAfter",
    "tableText": "Name | Notes\nBold and italic | old code\nAlice Smith | Spec\nbold and italic | "
