    "markdown": "Before\n\n| A\\|B | Lines |\n| --- | --- |\n| a\\\\\\|b and \\[literal\\] &lt;br&gt; &amp; | one<br>two<br>three |\n| ``x\\|`y`` | a<br>b |\n\nAfter",
    "tableText": "A|B | Lines\na\\|b and [literal] <br> & | one / two / three\nx|`y | a / b"
  },
